# Savyre AI Coding Workflow

When the user is in a Savyre workflow session:

- Follow the active stage prompt from the Savyre panel.
- Write stage outputs to the paths listed in each stage (completion SoT is `final.md`).
- Do not modify protected files listed in `.savyre/config.json`.
- After Stage 01, only edit `developer-review.md`; other stage artifacts are AI/system-owned.
